      "message": "Unrelated to this change, just trying to understand the hidden-API stuff better:\n\nWill modules need to add a lot of these hidden-API files too BCP fragments? Why are there so many different files and why do each need to be set to a list of user controlled paths? I get the impression there is too much room for arbitrary configuration - it\u0027s not possible to be more opinionated, i.e. just stipulating that there has to be, say, a subdirectory with a fixed name \"hiddenapi\" containing text files with equally fixed names?",
